  "body": "ACT FAST: MOTIVATED OWNERS ARE READY TO MOVE!A change in circumstances means the owners of 39 Argo Drive are clear-this spectacular Bucklands Beach sanctuary must sell. For astute buyers looking to secure serious value in an elite Macleans College location, your window of opportunity is right now.  \r\n\r\nWhy You Can't Afford to Wait Serious Value Alert: Positioned well below its $3.735M Ratable Value (CV), this is a rare chance to buy into a premier coastal dress circle at outstanding buying levels.\r\n\r\nUncompromising Proportions: Sprawled over an expansive 1,211 m² land section with 360 m² of architecturally designed space, complete with 5 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms (plus 3 separate toilets), and room for the boat.   Panoramic Estuary Views: floor-to-ceiling glass captures active water vistas out to Rangitoto-a backdrop you'll never tire of coming home to.   \r\n\r\nMacleans College Zone: Blue-chip schooling guaranteed for your family's future. Minutes to the Marina: Walk to Half Moon Bay for world-class dining, coastal strolls, or the ferry straight into the Auckland CBD. \r\n\r\nDo Not Let This One Pass You By Properties of this scale, setting, and location with genuinely motivated vendors do not stay on the market for long. \r\n\r\nSubmit your offer and secure your ultimate coastal lifestyle today!",
